:bublbobr:00000000:E5DB:00000001:FFFFFFFF:Enable "Super" Mode:Baddies from first 50 levels switch with last and levels change colour, Title will display "Super" if enabled before title displayed. Same as "1P,Jump,Bubble,Left,Right,Jump,1P,Right" on Title Screen
