; [ Herbie at the Olympics (DK conversion) ]
:herbiedk:00000000:1E50:00000099:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Credits
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[Turn OFF Infinite Time     ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[before you finish a race   ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[or it may crash the game!  ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[You only need it for       ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[running events anyway!     ]
:herbiedk:00000022:1E54:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Time
:herbiedk:00000000:1ECA:000000FF:FFFFFFFF:Top Speed
:herbiedk:00000000:1C51:00000006:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Lives PL1
:herbiedk:00000101:1E95:00000005:FFFFFFFF:Set High Jump Bar Height PL1
:herbiedk:00000001:1E95:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Set HJ Bar = Minimum Now! PL1
:herbiedk:00000001:1E95:00000005:FFFFFFFF:Set HJ Bar = Maximum Now! PL1
:herbiedk:00000000:1C52:00000006:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Lives PL2
:herbiedk:00000101:1E96:00000005:FFFFFFFF:Set High Jump Bar Height PL2
:herbiedk:00000001:1E96:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Set HJ Bar = Minimum Now! PL2
:herbiedk:00000001:1E96:00000005:FFFFFFFF:Set HJ Bar = Maximum Now! PL2
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[A neato trick is to set the]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[HJ (High Jump) bar to the  ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[minimum (0) and after you  ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[have cleared the bar       ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[quickly hit HOME and set   ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[the bar to the maximum (5).]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[You then pass at the       ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[highest setting, it clocks ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[the game, and you are back ]
:herbiedk:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[to the 100m Dash.          ]

