:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[A neato trick is to set the]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[HJ (High Jump) bar to the  ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[minimum (0) and after you  ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[have cleared the bar       ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[quickly hit HOME and set   ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[the bar to the maximum (5).]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[You then pass at the       ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[highest setting, it clocks ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[the game, and you are back ]
:hncholms:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[to the 100m Dash.          ]

