:hourouki:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[ The winning hand cheat must   ]
:hourouki:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[ be activated when there are   ]
:hourouki:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[ 14 tiles in your hand, then   ]
