:kf2k2pla:00000700:10A81E:00000002:00000003:Select Order Number (A) PL2:What this does is allow you to obfuscate your team order, which would mean that with these cheats on, you would be able to hide your order until your match begins
:kf2k2pla:00000700:10A81F:00000002:00000003:Select Order Number (B) PL2:What this does is allow you to obfuscate your team order, which would mean that with these cheats on, you would be able to hide your order until your match begins
:kf2k2pla:00000700:10A820:00000002:00000003:Select Order Number (C) PL2:What this does is allow you to obfuscate your team order, which would mean that with these cheats on, you would be able to hide your order until your match begins
:kf2k2pla:62000000:000000:00000000:00000000:Select Roulette Status (A) PL2:This determines if your character is selected by Roulette (ie. whether or not your character changes each match because you selected them randomly).
:kf2k2pla:00010000:10A82A:00000000:00000080:Not Selected by Roulette
:kf2k2pla:00010000:10A82A:00000080:00000080:Selected by Roulette
:kf2k2pla:62000000:000000:00000000:00000000:Select Roulette Status (B) PL2:This determines if your character is selected by Roulette (ie. whether or not your character changes each match because you selected them randomly).
:kf2k2pla:00010000:10A82B:00000000:00000080:Not Selected by Roulette
:kf2k2pla:00010000:10A82B:00000080:00000080:Selected by Roulette
:kf2k2pla:62000000:000000:00000000:00000000:Select Roulette Status (C) PL2:This determines if your character is selected by Roulette (ie. whether or not your character changes each match because you selected them randomly).
:kf2k2pla:00010000:10A82C:00000000:00000080:Not Selected by Roulette
:kf2k2pla:00010000:10A82C:00000080:00000080:Selected by Roulette
