:kof97pls:00000000:10EC35:00000001:FFFFFFFF:Backdrop Always Red:Makes the backdrop turn red (like how the stage would change in 1P mode when you face Orochi Iori or Orochi Leona).
:kof97pls:00000001:10EC35:00000001:FFFFFFFF:Backdrop Turns Red Now!:Activate between matches for best effect. Makes the backdrop turn red (like how the stage would change in 1P mode when you face Orochi Iori or Orochi Leona).
:kof97pls:20800000:01436E:000000EC:FFFFFFFF:No Damage Dealt While Defending:Affects both players. ALL attacks do no damage when blocked - hence, a player takes no block damage.
