:kof99a:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ Enable refers to being able to select on    ]
:kof99a:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ character select screen, unlock refers to   ]
:kof99a:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ being able to perform the enable code.      ]
:kof99a:40800001:D003FC:0000000F:FFFFFFFF:Unlock Kyo + Iori in NVRAM:Enable and reset. Won't work on big-endian machines. Displays <K.I> on title screen. Afterwards, use the following; Hold "Start" over [?] and press "Left,Right,Up,Left,Down,Right" to enable Kyo. Hold "Start" over [?] and press "Right,Left,Up,Right,Down,Left" to enable Iori.
:kof99a:40800001:D003FC:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Lock Kyo + Iori in NVRAM:Enable and reset. Won't work on big-endian machines.
