:mk:39B00000:093F12:0300C0E2:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Time
;ROM Hack, Converted from existing code (This comment is true for the Inf Time cheats for the MK series games, Divide by 8 the addresses given by the debugger and swap LSB & MSB for each word to get correct addresses and datas within the cheat engine. Time is coded on 2 REGISTERS (00-09 * 2) , register A10 (LSB) - register A11 (MSB))
