; [ Mahjong Keibaou (Japan) ]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[The winning hand cheat must]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[be activated when there are]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[14 tiles in your hand, then]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[press the RON key .        ]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[('Z' by default). The tiles]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[do not visually change     ]
:mkeibaou:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[until you make a move.     ]
