:mvsc:00100000:FF39C0:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Eddie Yobi:qcb+K ### The strength of the Eddie Yobi used determines what weapon is dropped on the ground (Rock Ball for LK, Tornado Hold for MK, Leaf Shield for HK). ###
