:mvscar1:00100000:FF31D8:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Cajun Explosion (Zenpou):qcf+KK ### Remy's Cajun Explosion (Zenpou) will make him jump to the wall in front of him. If he doesn't land on a wall, you won't lose any super bar. ###
