:mvscar1:00100000:FF35A8:00000808:FFFFFFFF:Cajun Strike:*d,(ub|u|uf)+K ### With the Cajun Strike, ub or uf leaps to that wall, while u makes Remy jump to the closest wall. When at a wall, pressing in the opposite direction will make him go to the other wall before attacking. ###
:mvscar1:00100000:FF35B0:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Royal Flush (Hyper Combo):qcf+PP
:mvscar1:00100000:FF35B8:00000808:FFFFFFFF:Cajun Escape:*d,(ub|u|uf)+P ### With the Cajun Escape, ub or uf leaps to that wall, while u makes Remy jump to the closest wall. When at a wall, pressing in the opposite direction will make him go to the other wall before attacking. ###
