:mvscb:00100000:FF39A8:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Beat Plane (Hyper Combo):qcb+KK (air) ### You can move freely in the Beat Plane (Hyper Combo). ###
:mvscb:00100000:FF39B0:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Item Kougeki:qcf+P ### You cannot pick up items while having the Leaf Shield. You can fire the Leaf Shield by performing the Item Kougeki either on the ground or in the air. ###
