:mvscj:00100000:FF31D0:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Cajun Explosion (Kouhou):qcb+KK ### Remy's Cajun Explosion (Kouhou) will make him jump to the wall behind him. If he doesn't land on a wall, you won't lose any super bar. ###
