:mvscu:00100000:FF3598:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Mega Upper:dp+P
:mvscu:00100000:FF35A0:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Rush Drill (Hyper Combo):qcf+KK ### You can move freely in the Rush Drill (Hyper Combo). ###
:mvscu:00100000:FF35A8:00000606:FFFFFFFF:Beat Plane (Hyper Combo):qcb+KK (air) ### You can move freely in the Beat Plane (Hyper Combo). ###
