:mvscu:00100000:FF31A8:00000808:FFFFFFFF:Cajun Strike:*d,(ub|u|uf)+K ### With the Cajun Strike, ub or uf leaps to that wall, while u makes Remy jump to the closest wall. When at a wall, pressing in the opposite direction will make him go to the other wall before attacking. ###
