:rbff1:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ down, down + C (SDM), some characters that  ]
:rbff1:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ have more than 2 SDMs can use the B or D    ]
:rbff1:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ buttons as well.                            ]
