:rbff1:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ screen. If you activate it during any fight ]
:rbff1:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ however you will see the ENDING after you   ]
:rbff1:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[ win that match!                             ]
