:ridefgtj:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[effect you will have to reset the game (F3).    ]
:ridefgtj:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[Then you may have to turn the Test Mode ON (F2),]
:ridefgtj:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[reset again (F3), wait for Test Mode to appear  ]
