:sailorwa:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[be activated when there are]
:sailorwa:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[14 tiles in your hand, then]
:sailorwa:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[press the RON key .        ]
:sailorwa:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[('Z' by default). The tiles]
:sailorwa:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[do not visually change     ]
:sailorwa:60000000:0000:00000000:00000000:[until you make a move.     ]
