:shaolins:20810000:8587:000000A6:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Energy (2/2):Part 1 takes care of sprite collisions energy drains & Part 2 takes care of falling off platform energy drains
:shaolins:20800000:9984:00000012:FFFFFFFF:Invincibility:Note, you can still fall off gaps in platforms and lose energy use this with Infinite Energy or Walk on Air to counteract it.
:shaolins:20810000:9985:00000016:FFFFFFFF:Invincibility (2/3):Part 1 + 2 = Changing a 4 byte branch to a 3 byte BRA, NOP first then a LBRA instruction (for most fighters)
:shaolins:20810000:9A66:00000020:FFFFFFFF:Invincibility (3/3):Changes a BCC to a BRA (for bosses)
:shaolins:20800000:822B:00000020:FFFFFFFF:Walk on Air:This will stop you falling off ends of platforms
