:srmp7:60000000:00000:00000000:00000000:[ there are 14 tiles in your hand, then press the   ]
:srmp7:60000000:00000:00000000:00000000:[ RON key ('Z' by default). The tiles do not        ]
:srmp7:60000000:00000:00000000:00000000:[ visually change until you make a move.            ]
