:ssi:00000000:2052E3:00000002:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Powerup PL2
; The Always Have cheats for Hyper Laser, Fire Flower,
; and Destroy beam have two parts. 205534 always
; needs to be set to 03, because that's what signals
; the game that you've just picked up something
; from the mystery ship and that it needs to check what
; it is. 205537 is the heart of the cheat; its value
; tells the game which power you have (or if you
; don't have any, in which case it's zeroed).
; Buster Laser and Time Stop have an additional part
; which is the same as "Long Lasting Weapons" below;
; without it, Buster Laser will keep turning on and off
; and Time Stop will immediately expire.
;
:ssi:00000000:205534:00000003:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Buster Laser
:ssi:00010000:20553F:00000030:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Buster Laser (2/3)
:ssi:00010000:205537:00000001:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Buster Laser (3/3)
:ssi:00000000:205534:00000003:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Hyper Laser
:ssi:00010000:205537:00000002:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Hyper Laser (2/2)
:ssi:00000000:205534:00000003:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Fire Flower
:ssi:00010000:205537:00000003:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Fire Flower (2/2)
:ssi:00000000:205534:00000003:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Destroy Beam
:ssi:00010000:205537:00000006:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Destroy Beam (2/2)
:ssi:00000000:205534:00000003:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Time Stop
:ssi:00010000:20553F:00000030:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Time Stop (2/3)
:ssi:00010000:205537:00000007:FFFFFFFF:Always Have Time Stop (3/3)
:ssi:00000000:20553F:00000030:FFFFFFFF:Long Lasting Weapons
:ssi:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[The backdrops don't change ]
:ssi:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[for a couple of levels with]
:ssi:60000000:000000:00000000:00000000:[these level cheats.        ]
