:sutapper:20800000:0798:000000C3:FFFFFFFF:Invincibility:Glasses will continue on their journey until collected and you won't get pulled down the bar. THe overall effect can be quite strange and there's only so many glasses sprites to go around so you might have to collect some empties to pull some more.
