:sutapper:20810000:08E9:00000018:FFFFFFFF:Invincibility (6/6):Parts 5-6 stop angry and 'legless' customers pulling you down the bar...they just continue going
:sutapper:00000001:E711:00000001:FFFFFFFF:Serve one beer on this level
