:wsf:00000020:E788:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Infinite Time:Enable this cheat before the match starts or the 'Finish Match Now!' will probably not work!
:wsf:00000001:E788:00000030:FFFFFFFF:Finish Match Now!:Only works properly if you have previously enabled Infinite Time
;Time is calculated in a strange way. No absolute value for match time. A timer is continually going. E787/E788 hold
;the timer value. Increase the value of E788 after match starts by about 0x30 to expire enough time to finish match.
:wsf:00000000:E0C4:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Score always = 0 PL1/PL3:Only updates when the display updates
:wsf:00010000:E10C:00000000:FFFFFFFF:Score always = 0 PL1/PL3 (2/2):Can't do score choosing as both values need to be set. First is for proper score.Second is to determine win/lose. It does not increase FOR goal tally unfortunately.
